CM_ SG_ 1282 MaxBusCurrent "Limit on current drawn from the DC bus (battery), as a percentage of the controller's absolute bus current limit. TODO: add whether this is sent as 0 to 1 or 0 to 100 (the unit says %), from the WaveSculptor22 user manual.";
CM_ SG_ 1282 Zero "Reserved, always 0.";
CM_ BO_ 35 "Reset command for the left motor controller. From an earlier two-motor set-up (separate left and right controllers). Not seen in Tests/data/NRT.BIN. TODO: add whether Peri uses this message; if not, remove it from this file.";
CM_ BO_ 65 "Drive command for the right motor controller. From an earlier two-motor set-up (separate left and right controllers). Not seen in Tests/data/NRT.BIN. TODO: add whether Peri uses this message; if not, remove it from this file.";
CM_ SG_ 65 MotorCurrent "Motor current requested, as a percentage of the controller's maximum current setting. TODO: add whether this is sent as 0 to 1 or 0 to 100 (the unit says %), from the WaveSculptor22 user manual.";
CM_ SG_ 65 MotorVelocity "Target motor speed requested, in metres per second.";
CM_ BO_ 66 "Power command for the right motor controller. From an earlier two-motor set-up (separate left and right controllers). Not seen in Tests/data/NRT.BIN. TODO: add whether Peri uses this message; if not, remove it from this file.";
CM_ SG_ 66 BusCurrent "Limit on current drawn from the DC bus (battery), as a percentage of the controller's absolute bus current limit.";
CM_ BO_ 67 "Reset command for the right motor controller. From an earlier two-motor set-up (separate left and right controllers). Not seen in Tests/data/NRT.BIN. TODO: add whether Peri uses this message; if not, remove it from this file.";
